SUMMARY:Truckers Against Trafficking (TAT)
LOCATION:Tampa Convention Center 333 S Franklin St Tampa \, FL 33602 Unite
 d States
DESCRIPTION:Truckers Against Trafficking (TAT) is a nonprofit organization
  that trains truck drivers\, transit operators\, and other transportation 
 workers to recognize and report instances of human trafficking. Provides f
 ree training programs and materials teaching workers how to spot the physi
 cal and behavioral signs of trafficking. First time event at TCC and group
  is expecting around 150 people. A 53 trailer and truck will be on display
  in Front Drive Zone 3 along with vendors around the perimeter of the Sail
  Event Plaza. Location: Tampa Convention Center Outdoors \n\nPermalink: ht
 tps://www.tampa.gov/node/196696
